## libwowexec.so (own, GPL-3.0)

**Component:** `libwowexec.so`
**Source:** `app/src/main/cpp/wowexec/wow_exec.c` in this repository; host tests in `tools/wowexec-tests/`.
**License:** GPL-3.0, like the application.

A small `LD_PRELOAD` shim loaded into the Wine / Proton processes. Android does not let an
app run programs from its own data folder or make mapped file pages executable (W^X), so
the shim starts such programs through `/system/bin/linker64`, answers `/proc/self/exe` with
the real program, and copies file-backed code pages to anonymous memory when Android
refuses to make them executable. It was written for this project without using
GameNative's closed `libredirect.so`; its approach follows the open GPL-3.0 shims of
[Bliss-Bass/GameNative-x64](https://github.com/Bliss-Bass/GameNative-x64)
(`exec_redirect.c`) and Droidtop (`exec-redirect.c`).

GameNative's `libredirect.so` (proprietary, all rights reserved by the GameNative
maintainers) is not part of this application.

