## Other bundled components

- **Vulkan wrapper** (`graphics_driver/wrapper.txz`, `libvulkan_wrapper.so`):
  leegao/mesa-wrapper-CI e03c3486fcda, MIT, unmodified apart from removed debug
  information.
- **Bionic Windows environment** (`imagefs_bionic.txz`):
  the GameNative/Winlator bionic image, built with the Termux toolchain, slimmed by us (it carries no
  command-line programs). It holds only the Android-built libraries Wine, the Vulkan wrapper and PulseAudio
  load: X11/xcb client libraries, SDL2, freetype, fontconfig, expat, libpng, zlib, zstd, brotli, bzip2, libdrm,
  the Vulkan loader, adrenotools hooks, ALSA, libsndfile, libltdl, GnuTLS with nettle, gmp, libidn2,
  libunistring and libiconv. Each keeps its own license (MIT/X11, BSD, zlib, LGPL-2.1+; gmp, nettle,
  libidn2 and libunistring are used under their GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-3.0-or-later dual license). Source:
  the upstream release of each library and the Termux package recipes (https://github.com/termux/termux-packages);
  the exact files are available on request under the offer above.
- **Container pattern** (`container_pattern_common.txz`): only an empty Wine folder skeleton. The
  GameNative version carried Microsoft's core web fonts (Arial, Times New Roman, Verdana and others) and Winlator's
  Windows helpers `wfm.exe` and `winhandler.exe`; they are no longer shipped, and the launcher deletes copies an
  older GameNative-based install left in the game's Wine prefix.
- **PulseAudio** (`pulseaudio-gamenative-20260919.tzst`, `jniLibs/libpulse*.so`,
  `libpulsecommon-13.0.so`, `libpulsecore-13.0.so`), **libsndfile** and **libltdl**:
  LGPL-2.1-or-later, unmodified GameNative builds. Source: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/,
