- **libadrenotools** (`app/src/main/cpp/extras/adrenotools`): BSD-2-Clause, see its LICENSE.
- **AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1 (EASU)**: ported into
  `app/src/main/cpp/winlator/window.frag` from GPUOpen `ffx_fsr1.h`, MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2021 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
- **WoWForeverywhere** by YoruDev-Ryland (https://github.com/YoruDev-Ryland/WoWForeverywhere):
  the addon backend in `app/src/main/java/app/gamenative/wow/addons`, GPL-3.0; see the NOTICE.md there.
